{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 2-8 players online in a fast-paced 2D battle royale where the last man standing wins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the game starts players move and never stop, leaving behind trails that fills the grid. One wrong move and you're dead until the next round begins. Use the trails you leave behind to your advantage to trap and block off other players, or secure a piece of the grid for yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840740/extras/53c0fb66a66817591b5519db24b90554.poster.avif?t=1771956858\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840740/extras/53c0fb66a66817591b5519db24b90554.webm?t=1771956858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840740/extras/53c0fb66a66817591b5519db24b90554.mp4?t=1771956858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boost</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the boost to chase down your opponents and cut them off.  Chase down your opponents and cut them off.\u00a0 Gain score and exp each time you kill an opponent or win a round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840740/extras/a078e525e375ed19b49eed93a3058f50.poster.avif?t=1771956858\" width=798 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840740/extras/a078e525e375ed19b49eed93a3058f50.webm?t=1771956858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840740/extras/a078e525e375ed19b49eed93a3058f50.mp4?t=1771956858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Original Grid comes in smaller and larger variations for a classic experience where the only obstacles are the trails you leave behind, while the Complex Grid's have obstacles, walls, and paths already set in place that the player must maneuver through. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840740/extras/de8fa7ff5c287e6aab7737a799a2c84a.poster.avif?t=1771956858\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840740/extras/de8fa7ff5c287e6aab7737a799a2c84a.webm?t=1771956858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840740/extras/de8fa7ff5c287e6aab7737a799a2c84a.mp4?t=1771956858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gamemodes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free for all and Team Deathmatch gamemodes where the goal is simple, be the last player or team left standing to win the round. Reach the maximum round goal and win the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2840740?t=1771956858","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2840740?t=1771956858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840740/00581d3adeab5729e152898192e67645b6b8eecd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771956858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840740/00581d3adeab5729e152898192e67645b6b8eecd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771956858","categories":[{"des